      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/corona",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 7 train stops at 103rd‑Street and 111th‑Street link Corona to Midtown Manhattan and Flushing, while bridges connect to Flushing Meadows‑Corona Park.",
